  'Heroes never die — and neither does this cast. Tanks, supports and payloads from Blizzard''s hero shooter. Can you name them all?',
  'trivia',
  'medium',
  'en',
  (select id from public.categories where slug = 'gaming'),
  '[{"id":"q1","question":"Which company created Overwatch?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Riot Games","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Blizzard Entertainment","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Electronic Arts","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Valve","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Blizzard released it in 2016; it grew out of the cancelled MMO Project Titan."},{"id":"q2","question":"In which year was the original Overwatch released?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2014","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"2016","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"2018","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"2020","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"It launched on 24 May 2016 and won Game of the Year at The Game Awards that December."},{"id":"q3","question":"What are the three hero roles in Overwatch?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Warrior, Mage and Healer","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Tank, Damage and Support","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Vanguard, Striker and Medic","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Tank, Sniper and Support","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Every hero fits one of the three: Tank, Damage or Support."},{"id":"q4","question":"Which time-travelling hero is the face of the franchise?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Soldier: 76","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Widowmaker","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Tracer","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Mei","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Tracer — ''Cheers, love! The cavalry''s here!'' — fronted the game''s cover and key art."},{"id":"q5","question":"In Escort maps, what do attackers push to the finish line?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"The objective beacon","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"The hover tank","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"The supply crate","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"The payload","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"Attackers escort the payload through checkpoints while the defence stalls it."},{"id":"q6","question":"Which hero fights inside a pink mech?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Reinhardt","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"D.Va","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Orisa","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Wrecking Ball","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"D.Va, a former pro gamer, pilots the mech; Wrecking Ball is a hamster in a rolling ball."},{"id":"q7","question":"How many players per team did Overwatch 2 switch to?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Four","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Five","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Six","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Seven","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Overwatch 2 moved from 6v6 to 5v5 when it launched in 2022, dropping one tank per team."},{"id":"q8","question":"Which team won the inaugural Overwatch League season in 2018?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"New York Excelsior","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"San Francisco Shock","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Seoul Dynasty","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"London Spitfire","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"London Spitfire took the first Grand Finals; the Shock won the next two titles."}]'::jsonb,
